<title>NORWAY: Technical problems halt trade on Oslo bourse.</title>
<headline>Technical problems halt trade on Oslo bourse.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>All trading on the Oslo bourse was suspended on Wednesday due to technical difficulties, bourse authorities said.</p>
<p>Activity was halted at 1330 GMT when the entire trading system broke down.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
